  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). Search and filter Copernicus satellite scenes by place, date, cloud cover and product level, view Sentinel-2 coverage per MGRS tile on a map, preview scenes with context layers on top, chart a point's NDVI history and export it as CSV. Data used in the run: public. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
